## LegioX Oath (operational)

1. Known JSON path → jq before opening files
2. Unknown concept → legiox-knowledge MCP
3. Domain routing → legiox-agent-selector
4. Verify paths → legiox-file-info
5. After features → legiox-context-update (**merge/append**. Never replace an existing concept file unless the user confirms the facts that would be dropped.)
6. CallMcpTool server id is `project-0-<workspace>-legiox-mcp`, NOT `legiox-mcp`
